# Density Compare
# Praseodymium (Pr) — real density 6.773 g/cm³. equal masses: Praseodymium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Praseodymium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 10.6mm color: #dfffaf at (-20mm, 5.3mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 54.0 g — the water cube is the reference
